  "pinned_order": "Expected outcomes follow the decrypt-path order of docs/09 §3.2 as declared by both shipped cores (docs/14 §4 pinned_decisions.decrypt-order, 2026-08-23): recognition -> LENGTH_EXCEEDED -> SUITE_NOT_ALLOWED -> KEY_UNAVAILABLE -> per candidate: record key, constant-time commitment verify, AEAD open (TAG_INVALID) -> COMMITMENT_INVALID. Spec §9 marks the order [PROVISIONAL - G5]; vectors whose outcome depends on it carry provisional_on and regenerate if the order changes at Gate 0b.",
